  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritise pay cards (1, 3, 5, 7, 10, 12) when building melds; they translate directly into payment.\n\nUse forcing to disrupt opponents: if the centre card extends an opponent's meld, force it onto them to waste their hand and block their win.\n\nCard-count pay cards across the table; avoid leaving key cards where opponents can force you to meld and discard needed cards.",
    Player: "Prioritise pay cards (1, 3, 5, 7, 10, 12) when building melds; they translate directly into payment.\n\nUse forcing to disrupt opponents: if the centre card extends an opponent's meld, force it onto them to waste their hand and block their win.\n\nCard-count pay cards across the table; avoid leaving key cards where opponents can force you to meld and discard needed cards.",
